###
### ValidationFault - tom titel ved oprettelse af bog
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
SOAPAction: "CreateBook"

<soap:Envelope xmlns:soap="http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/"
               xmlns:lib="http://soap.example.org/library">
    <soap:Body>
        <lib:createBookRequest>
            <lib:title></lib:title>
            <lib:authorId>1</lib:authorId>
            <lib:publishingCompanyId>2</lib:publishingCompanyId>
            <lib:publishingYear>2024</lib:publishingYear>
        </lib:createBookRequest>
    </soap:Body>
</soap:Envelope>

###
### ValidationFault - bog refererer til en forfatter, der ikke findes
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
SOAPAction: "CreateBook"

<soap:Envelope xmlns:soap="http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/"
               xmlns:lib="http://soap.example.org/library">
    <soap:Body>
        <lib:createBookRequest>
            <lib:title>Ugyldig reference</lib:title>
            <lib:authorId>999</lib:authorId>
            <lib:publishingCompanyId>2</lib:publishingCompanyId>
            <lib:publishingYear>2024</lib:publishingYear>
        </lib:createBookRequest>
    </soap:Body>
</soap:Envelope>

###
### NotFoundFault - bog med ID 999 findes ikke
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
SOAPAction: "GetBookById"

<soap:Envelope xmlns:soap="http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/"
               xmlns:lib="http://soap.example.org/library">
    <soap:Body>
        <lib:getBookByIdRequest>
            <lib:id>999</lib:id>
        </lib:getBookByIdRequest>
    </soap:Body>
</soap:Envelope>

